{"matched":125,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0171a01","n":"0171a","t":"十二門論序疏大業四年六月"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0171b01","n":"0171b","t":"觀不實不虛非得非失故名實"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0171c01","n":"0171c","t":"示此論深博故略敘眾義又此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0172a01","n":"0172a","t":"也盡其理者斥學小乘之流也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0172b01","n":"0172b","t":"門以正之者前總標由路今敘"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0172c01","n":"0172c","t":"足六度謂世諦也問云何為兼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0173a01","n":"0173a","t":"今明有為無為法畢竟空明理"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0173b01","n":"0173b","t":"今第三明得益得益有二初明"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0173c01","n":"0173c","t":"丁十二年不見全牛即牛體空"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0174a01","n":"0174a","t":"前令三乘得益今六道迴宗亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0174b01","n":"0174b","t":"悟此夢非夢即夢為覺也即百"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0174c01","n":"0174c","t":"累不寂隨病設藥一方事圓故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0175a01","n":"0175a","t":"門者即是經資於論由稟佛經"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0175b01","n":"0175b","t":"教門答有人言用理為門今謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0175c01","n":"0175c","t":"檢論文具以因緣與教為門但"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0176a01","n":"0176a","t":"假名正因緣故名觀因緣此明"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0176b01","n":"0176b","t":"乘論等雖復破邪邪猶未窮雖"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0176c01","n":"0176c","t":"而生為亦有亦無而生有不須"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0177a01","n":"0177a","t":"之異名般若之別稱又智度論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0177b01","n":"0177b","t":"者性乘謂真如二隨乘即萬行"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0177c01","n":"0177c","t":"後耶答龍樹傳及付法藏經並"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0178a01","n":"0178a","t":"謝大小稱為見論故名愛見論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0178b01","n":"0178b","t":"別明十二門以為論體三總結"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0178c01","n":"0178c","t":"云我欲正論三藏中實義此但"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0179a01","n":"0179a","t":"無生忍後更無餘事唯成就眾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0179b01","n":"0179b","t":"便悟道初又三初牒摩訶衍二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0179c01","n":"0179c","t":"末末是微末之義像是似末故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0180a01","n":"0180a","t":"際故菩薩建立眾生於實際然"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0180b01","n":"0180b","t":"量難可尋究我今略釋令取悟"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0180c01","n":"0180c","t":"待問若爾一切大名皆是相待"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0181a01","n":"0181a","t":"用立名明般若正觀能究源盡"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0181b01","n":"0181b","t":"教中亦有大乘但三乘教中猶"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0181c01","n":"0181c","t":"故亦不同之今所釋者上以六"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0182a01","n":"0182a","t":"問自佛法西域而度誰前得此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0182b01","n":"0182b","t":"死故云通達大乘六度皆備此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0182c01","n":"0182c","t":"眾生悟無生忍此一雙也就異"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0183a01","n":"0183a","t":"婆多義薩婆多云未來有自性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0183b01","n":"0183b","t":"有二見因緣所生法此破內外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0183c01","n":"0183c","t":"言其無事緣既形如此了悟即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0184a01","n":"0184a","t":"理第四重二不二非二非不二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0184b01","n":"0184b","t":"無自性皆無自性俱無果因眾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0184c01","n":"0184c","t":"世諦今釋第一義諦論主更不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0185a01","n":"0185a","t":"他應當俱生二俱應不生三馬"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0185b01","n":"0185b","t":"自性無自性則無蒲以何為席"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0185c01","n":"0185c","t":"無生者實無外人所見生此是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0186a01","n":"0186a","t":"梨耶識即是心也前煩惱與種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0186b01","n":"0186b","t":"蹤橫計之我云何有耶因五陰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0186c01","n":"0186c","t":"是善餘二無記不足破之依成"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0187a01","n":"0187a","t":"生死非雜亂涅槃非寂靜也問"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0187b01","n":"0187b","t":"地故不須餘門則一一門皆具"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0187c01","n":"0187c","t":"問因緣亦以教為門今亦以教"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0188a01","n":"0188a","t":"相等中亦破有無今此門但就"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0188b01","n":"0188b","t":"生就破救論之問答凡有八番"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0188c01","n":"0188c","t":"邊汝今著有故言從是有邊今"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0189a01","n":"0189a","t":"未生是有亦應不生故此二門"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0189b01","n":"0189b","t":"復次下第六無用破自上已來"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0189c01","n":"0189c","t":"生之果此即未變是故得生不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0190a01","n":"0190a","t":"牒外義也問外前云因中有果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0190b01","n":"0190b","t":"宗故重破之破亦三前取外意"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0190c01","n":"0190c","t":"通第四難者因中先已有變此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0191a01","n":"0191a","t":"明始細終亦細今嘖本無麁果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0191b01","n":"0191b","t":"故果亦無復次下第四明果相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0191c01","n":"0191c","t":"亦無者乘無果勢破因也是故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0192a01","n":"0192a","t":"故與上為異破本有佛性義汝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0192b01","n":"0192b","t":"本有非緣所作是即以作為果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0192c01","n":"0192c","t":"二頭生者四大中無一頭亦無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0193a01","n":"0193a","t":"下總非何以故下釋非問此與"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0193b01","n":"0193b","t":"不成所以因不成者夫物得生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0193c01","n":"0193c","t":"此二難以難於我欲成汝因中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0194a01","n":"0194a","t":"十二門論疏卷中之本釋吉藏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0194b01","n":"0194b","t":"因果所以有後二門五者上有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0194c01","n":"0194c","t":"義因第一義故有世諦即出生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0195a01","n":"0195a","t":"後偈就非緣中撿果不得故一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0195b01","n":"0195b","t":"眾緣求生不得者此是汝所計"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0195c01","n":"0195c","t":"次第非無間第二念定也四非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0196a01","n":"0196a","t":"緣答取一切法別生心義為緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0196b01","n":"0196b","t":"非緣答有三義一者如泥是瓶"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0196c01","n":"0196c","t":"累無不寂則顯真實相故非常"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0197a01","n":"0197a","t":"破三相破通生法所以四緣是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0197b01","n":"0197b","t":"具如中論今更引婆沙誠文以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0197c01","n":"0197c","t":"何不一法一時而生則老即無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0198a01","n":"0198a","t":"現在故老令衰微無常能壞如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0198b01","n":"0198b","t":"為無為一切法相是故但標觀"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0198c01","n":"0198c","t":"部義即二關定二問曰下第二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0199a01","n":"0199a","t":"釋上半若生是無為下釋下半"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0199b01","n":"0199b","t":"生故生云何云非佛說耶答涅"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0199c01","n":"0199c","t":"相法體具四亦是大相也偈文"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0200a01","n":"0200a","t":"義無有一時之中有能生復有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0200b01","n":"0200b","t":"巧上難云二處無闇外則提破"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0200c01","n":"0200c","t":"破法說云今當更說者上破譬"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0201a01","n":"0201a","t":"二門責無無相者不然正不可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0201b01","n":"0201b","t":"相一剎那中有生住異滅此事"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0201c01","n":"0201c","t":"無相中相不相何法名無相下"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0202a01","n":"0202a","t":"一異答一為存略二欲遍觀一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0202b01","n":"0202b","t":"如自觸指復次下第二明相可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0202c01","n":"0202c","t":"義宗又汝墮亦一亦異燈為能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0203a01","n":"0203a","t":"第三門重破別相今重破通相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0203b01","n":"0203b","t":"離無有者牒也前有生住之有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0203c01","n":"0203c","t":"熱用若廢火體則廢若猶有火"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0204a01","n":"0204a","t":"相離次引阿毘曇明四相共起"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0204b01","n":"0204b","t":"相扶之力初又二第一四門別"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0204c01","n":"0204c","t":"識若無識能則不名識若爾當"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0205a01","n":"0205a","t":"例然他云外道毘曇可是性義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0205b01","n":"0205b","t":"乘人定作無性解捨性而存無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0205c01","n":"0205c","t":"而遂言有無性之無常故執著"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0206a01","n":"0206a","t":"能知之人得初言有二諦者外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0206b01","n":"0206b","t":"第一義即是實相見實相故斷"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0206c01","n":"0206c","t":"前云無性法亦無一切法空故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0207a01","n":"0207a","t":"又開二別前迴無四諦三寶過"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0207b01","n":"0207b","t":"毘曇實有因果體成實具二義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0207c01","n":"0207c","t":"破之也問若爾應言破無因有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0208a01","n":"0208a","t":"其本今次破末二者依內外次"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0208b01","n":"0208b","t":"累無不寂與樂使德無不圓故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0208c01","n":"0208c","t":"辨空第三論主答外人申佛經"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0209a01","n":"0209a","t":"四作無外道之苦而實有內苦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0209b01","n":"0209b","t":"解脫若無身能作苦者得涅槃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0209c01","n":"0209c","t":"竟空亦成佛故也初中有三一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0210a01","n":"0210a","t":"大乘得此空小乘人不得正是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0210b01","n":"0210b","t":"必從於因故果名有因當因時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0210c01","n":"0210c","t":"破破明空病亦空三門破破即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0211a01","n":"0211a","t":"之流不能心無依著初立於法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0211b01","n":"0211b","t":"而為利人顯道但學人封執定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0211c01","n":"0211c","t":"門明無生長行為三一總明三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0212a01","n":"0212a","t":"破其生已生之言所以然者外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1825_p0212b01","n":"0212b","t":"二賴時而生便有二生故名二"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T42n1825-十二門論疏","source":"CBETA T42n1825 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":125,"unit":"T42 頁欄"}